# Copy to .env on the box and fill in BEFORE first start. Never commit it.
# !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
# CONDUIT_SERVER_NAME is PERMANENT. It is baked into every user ID,
# room ID and event this server ever creates. Per the AssureBay plan it
# should be an AssureBay domain (e.g. matrix.assurebay.com) from day one.
# Do not start this stack with a placeholder name.
# !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
CONDUIT_SERVER_NAME=
